cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Photometry Calcium Preprocessing: a MATLAB pipeline for long fibre-photometry recordings"
abstract: >-
  A beginner-friendly MATLAB pipeline that preprocesses long fibre-photometry
  recordings (405-nm isosbestic and 470-nm calcium channels): LED-pulse
  extraction, removal of a periodic sawtooth from the 405 channel, low-pass
  filtering, double-exponential photobleaching correction, automatic artifact
  suggestions with manual removal, IRLS motion correction, dF/F, and standard
  and robust z-scores, saved without and with a 1-minute rolling median.
type: software
authors:
